This page defines the data used in each Colosseum rule.
__NOTOC__

==Format==
Generally rule info can be formatted like normal wikitext. However, sometimes the rules will be ever so slightly different, for example [[Round 1 (Uber Clearance)]] has only one uber being spawnable at one time while [[Round 1 (Uber Clearance 2)]] has two.

To deal with that we can add parameters like $1. In the case of Uber Clearance, $1 will also affect the plural, so we add in the plural "template" (it's not a real template but it's made to look like one) that gets expanded in the "clean_info" function in [[Module:ColosseumRule]]. Due to how wikitext works, the plural template must be surrounded with <code>&lt;nowiki&gt;</code>.

